==Battleground==
*1 [[Those Guys]] spawns.
*8 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 0.07~2 seconds<sup>2f~60f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s (100%) spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 2~6.67 seconds<sup>60f~200f</sup>.
*3 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 38.67 seconds<sup>1,160f</sup>, delay 0.67~2 seconds<sup>20f~60f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 65.33 seconds<sup>1,960f</sup>, delay 10~30 seconds<sup>300f~900f</sup>.
*3 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 0.67~1.33 seconds<sup>20f~40f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Monkey King (Enemy)|Monkey King]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1.33~4 seconds<sup>40f~120f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s (150%) spawn, delay 1.33~6 seconds<sup>40f~180f</sup>.
**3 [[Doge Dark]]s (100%) spawn, delay 0.07~0.13 seconds<sup>2f~4f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

